---
import { notifyHref } from '../../config/site';
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro';
import InkLink from '../ui/InkLink.astro';
---

<section id="questions" class="faq defer-render" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="running-head t-label">
      <span class="num">08</span>Questions
    </p>
    <div class="grid-12 layout">
      <h2 id="faq-title" class="t-display">
        Good to know.
      </h2>
      <div class="list">
        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>Is Aftertaste free?</span>
            <Icon name="plus" size={20} class="mark" />
          </summary>
          <p>Yes, it is free to use. The Play Store version will have an optional tip. It unlocks nothing.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>When can I get it?</span>
            <Icon name="plus" size={20} class="mark" />
          </summary>
          <p>
            It is coming to Google Play soon. <InkLink href={notifyHref}>Email me</InkLink> and I will tell you when it
            is live.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>Is there an iPhone app?</span>
            <Icon name="plus" size={20} class="mark" />
          </summary>
          <p>No. Aftertaste is for Android only.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>How do I sign in?</span>
            <Icon name="plus" size={20} class="mark" />
          </summary>
          <p>With your Google account. There is no password to remember and no other way to sign in.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>Can my friends see my diary?</span>
            <Icon name="plus" size={20} class="mark" />
          </summary>
          <p>
            Only if you switch on sharing, and even then never your notes, favourites or Want to try list.{' '}
            <InkLink href="/support#what-friends-see">See exactly what is shared</InkLink>.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>
            <span>How do I delete my account?</span>
            <Icon name="plus" size={20} class="mark" />
          </summary>
          <p>
            In the app: Profile, Settings, Delete account.{' '}
            <InkLink href="/support#delete-account">Other ways and what gets deleted</InkLink>.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq {
    padding-block-start: var(--space-section);
  }

  .layout {
    row-gap: var(--space-block);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-block);
  }

  .list {
    border-block-start: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  details {
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  summary {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--s-16);
    min-block-size: var(--touch);
    padding-block: var(--s-20);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-card-title);
    line-height: var(--lh-card-title);
    list-style: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  summary :global(.mark) {
    flex: none;
    color: var(--primary);
    transition: transform var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out);
  }

  details[open] summary :global(.mark) {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  details p {
    max-inline-size: 36rem;
    padding-block-end: var(--s-24);
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (width >= 64rem) {
    h2 {
      grid-column: 1 / span 4;
    }
    .list {
      grid-column: 6 / -1;
    }
  }
</style>
